Indicator Design

Copyright (c) 2026 olchu. All rights reserved.

The "Indicator Design" is the look and motion of FlowType's recording
indicators: the Waves, Dots, Aurora, Particles and Bars styles, with their
shapes, colours, palettes and animations, and these files that draw them:

  FlowType/UI/WaveIndicatorView.swift
  FlowType/UI/WaveAppearance.swift
  FlowType/UI/DotsIndicatorView.swift
  FlowType/UI/AuroraIndicatorView.swift
  FlowType/UI/AuroraRenderer.swift
  FlowType/UI/AuroraShader.metal
  FlowType/UI/ParticleFieldIndicatorView.swift
  FlowType/UI/ParticleFieldRenderer.swift
  FlowType/UI/ParticleFieldShader.metal

The MIT License above does not apply to the Indicator Design. You may view it,
and build and run FlowType from this repository for your own use. You may not
copy, adapt or redistribute it, on its own or as part of another app or
product, without written permission from the copyright holder. A fork or a
derived app that is published must remove the Indicator Design or replace it
with its own.

This section applies from the version that adds it. Versions published before
it remain under the MIT License.
